roles: bench,runner,services,coordination
expect: ^REGISTRY OK
forge: registry

# The forge decides this one. On 2026-09-18 space carried sixteen ONLINE space-nova-* runners
# serving merge-group shards while machines.tsv called it `bench,services` -- so THE LOCK,
# which exists to keep cards off machines that serve the merge group, was happy to put cards
# on one. The registry is the file every guard reads; a registry that disagrees with the
# forge is a guard that guards nothing. The verdict is computed in Go and this body is never
# run on a machine.
echo "REGISTRY OK is decided by the forge against the machines registry's roles"
